<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended June 6, compared with the May 30 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.54 vs 5.43</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............4.91 vs 4.94</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.68 vs 5.67</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.61 vs 5.59</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.68 vs 5.69</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.69 vs 5.69</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.86 vs 6.99</p>
</text>
